Usage: ruralz bundle validate [DIR] [FLAGS]

Offline validation, source-mapped diagnostics.

Arguments:
  DIR  Bundle directory or one-file Bundle (default .)

Flags:
  --env NAME           Environment to render with (needs --environments)
  --environments FILE  Local Environment resources
  --help               Print this help
  --online             Also check Plugin artifacts
  --output text|json   Output format (text or json, default text)
